<aura:documentation>
	<aura:description>Documentation</aura:description>
	<aura:example name="San Mateo Community College" ref="exampleComponentName" label="Label">
		Community college client wanted to display a sample task list for students within their Experience Cloud student community.  The component would display student complete, incomplete tasks and whether the tasks were overdue or not.
		
		The component is built using Lightning Aura Component, JavaScript, CSS, HTML, Salesforce Lightning Design System (SLDS), and base Salesforce Lightning Components.  The client had installed Salesforce Education Cloud.

		This is an example of the component built for my client imagined as a directory of contacts assigned to accounts and display their assigned tasks.
	</aura:example>
</aura:documentation>